{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"0c3d9a79c5379226d5a2dd06f1c090af07cf60f165c0131953bf5407c5cda659","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM runner / usage logging","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/usage_log.py","src/rebar/llm/runner.py","PydanticAIRunner.run","REBAR_USAGE_LOG",".github/workflows/external-integration.yml",".github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml","tests/unit/test_usage_log.py","_usage","record","summarize"],"problem_keywords":["token usage recording","llm observability","weekly jobs","external integration","eval live","github actions","telemetry sink"],"propositions":["Weekly LLM jobs (external-integration and prompt-eval) make billable API calls but produce no retrievable token usage record.","Token usage data is computed at PydanticAIRunner.run but is lost because the eval path drops _usage, pytest logs are suppressed by NullHandler, and langfuse spans are ephemeral.","A new usage_log module with record() and summarize() functions captures token counts (input/output/cache/requests) to JSONL when REBAR_USAGE_LOG env var is set, enabling both job summaries and durable artifacts.","PydanticAIRunner.run must call usage_log.record() after computing _usage to wire the shared seam that covers both weekly jobs without per-test plumbing."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787422101442746001,"uuid":"f6dab0b8-5c20-474a-b142-fde3c2f6cf36"}